# The build context is the repo, and everything a conversion produces or
# consumes is far larger than the kit itself. The zips alone are 1.4 GB and are
# mounted at run time rather than baked in.
.git
# Both spellings: a pattern without ** matches the context root alone, and the
# archives are as likely to sit beside compose.yaml as above it.
*.zip
**/*.zip
client/
src/
build/
deps/
server/db/
server/data/
server/bin/
server/logs/
server/backups/
server/mariadb-*/
*.log
